,"name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"OAjof8dhS2zScmZh2Xuo1A","review_id":"E_nZ83ctLmgySsYR5QQ0Pg","date":"2012-11-26T20:15:22","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9426335692405701,"text_excerpt":"I live just 4 blocks away so I go here often. I had never been to Whole Foods before so I can't compare it to other locations, but it seems nice. I like their selections of fruit, vegetables, cheese, and wine. Their raw seafood seems impressive but I have yet to partake so I'll update you once I have. Living by myself for awhile I would go here and pick up some of their already cooked items like salmon or chicken and then get a side of mushrooms or cucumber salad. It was (relatively) cheap (for Whole Foods!), quick, and easy. The people who work here are always so nice. They never hesitate to help you find what you need or ask you about your day in the checkout line. Once they even opened..."},{"business_id":"OAjof8dhS2zScmZh2Xuo1A","review_id":"yvn9Z4V7B1UFX1WhQdB0UA","date":"2012-04-17T15:52:39","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9411443471908569,"text_excerpt":"Whole Foods is my favorite place to shop for food. When I cook, I want to use the best ingredients I can get especially when it comes to produce, meat and cheese. I can get all of those and I know they are super fresh from Whole Foods. Love the butcher counter, the guys back there are super friendly and helpful, gonna say that they are kinda flirtatious when it comes to helping a girl pick out her meat. Boy did one of them get excited when I asked for some help selecting some sausage. But as far as the quality goes, I can definitely tell the difference between the meat I get there and the meat I would get at say a Rouses or Winn Dixie. I am so spoiled by it I won't even go to those places..."},{"business_id":"OAjof8dhS2zScmZh2Xuo1A","review_id":"VZGtdSm_P42APLQvQ7gXsA","date":"2015-03-07T02:37:10","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9375869035720825,"text_excerpt":"Oh Whole Foods! For those who know my reviews, I'm not a fan of spending large amount of time shopping or in stores in general but there is something about this place. It could be the variety of health products, it could be the salad bar or the premise foods but I can spend a good amount of time in whole foods without getting anxiety. Compared to the whole foods off Broad in Midcity, I believe this maybe a smaller location and there isn't a dedicated parking lot but this place still provides great customer service, delicious baked goods, and awesome selection. You can find me here during my lunch breaks."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"OAjof8dhS2zScmZh2Xuo1A","photo_id":"m7s8_GSflEDg1BMBeJiOyw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/m7s8_GSflEDg1BMBeJiOyw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9219377040863037},{"business_id":"OAjof8dhS2zScmZh2Xuo1A","photo_id":"o7KJVEEGbqtQIYZcTs3iPg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/o7KJVEEGbqtQIYZcTs3iPg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.919765830039978},{"business_id":"OAjof8dhS2zScmZh2Xuo1A","photo_id":"NxtRSEWv85sqaPutGj8Frw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/NxtRSEWv85sqaPutGj8Frw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8778976202011108},{"business_id":"OAjof8dhS2zScmZh2Xuo1A","photo_id":"3somNXTbUv_d5iIgOsBdvA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/3somNXTbUv_d5iIgOsBdvA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8733527660369873},{"business_id":"OAjof8dhS2zScmZh2Xuo1A","photo_id":"4_BsE22B1-5EcwlaB6OrAQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/4_BsE22B1-5EcwlaB6OrAQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.821384072303772}]},"notebook_case":null}
